    "title": "中国共产党吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心总支部委员会换届选举大会隆重举行",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2019-10-29",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:28.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">根据厅直属机关党委《关于省高校毕业生就业指导中心党总支换届选举的批复》，就业中心党总支于<spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">2019年10月29日召开换届选举党员大会。中心党总支全体党员和部分积极分子参加大会，厅直属机关党委专职副书记、机关纪委书记鲁晶同志到会监督指导。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);><img src=\"assets/9dd09f3f6ba022bc78ef691d5568b2ee887be36121a89ddf082fb745b0c90f17.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">大会共分四项议程：第一项,全体起立唱国歌；第二项,唐洪丰同志代表现届党总支作总支委员会工作报告；第三项,由张旭光同志代表现届党总支作党费收缴使用情况报告; 第四项,选举新一届总支委员会。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);><img src=\"assets/b5536b1337b78c596aed39d0efb31240b1112432fafb2573f03976e3c4b86ef5.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><img src=\"assets/793795c6165eb18c180042cb851be6f9b2b862d3f6522de746003ec9b4233807.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">本次大会应到有表决权、选举权的党员30名，实到26名，达到五分之四的会议要求。大会采取无计名投票方式，发出选票26张，收回选票26张，其中有效票26张，无效票0张。按照党内选举的有关规定，王颖、陈淑敏、宋姣、张旭光、唐洪丰（按笔划顺序）5名同志组成新一届吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心总支部委员会。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">鲁晶书记代表厅党委向大会表示热烈祝贺，对中心党总支一直以来党建工作给予高度肯定。同时对新一届总支委员会工作提出了要求和期望。<spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">她说：“基层党组织是各项事业的坚强的组织保障，总支的支委成员不仅是你的荣誉，更是你的责任，要担当、要尽责，要充分调动党员干部立足岗位创新争优，使党建工作保持奋发进取、争创一流的劲头，把智慧和力量凝聚到工作上来。形成党员干部带头干、作表率的良好氛围。引导广大党员干部为官有为、为官能为、为官会为，推动各项重点工作的顺利完成。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">当日，新一届委员会召开了第一次全体委员会议。应到会人数5名，实到会人数5名。根据厅直属机关党委的批复，选举唐洪丰同志为就业中心党总支书记，张旭光同志为就业中心党总支副书记。同时进行了委员分工，宋姣同志为组织委员，陈淑敏同志为宣传委员，王颖同志为纪检委员。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><w:LatentStyles DefLockedState=\"false\"  DefUnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"  DefSemiHidden=\"true\"  DefQFormat=\"false\"  DefPriority=\"99\"  LatentStyleCount=\"260\" >\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"Normal\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 1\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 2\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 3\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 4\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 5\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 6\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 7\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 8\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 9\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"index 1\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"index 2\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  Sem